                "comment": "He's a very kind and patient professor who cares about his students' success. You need to go to lecture to get the printed slides (they aren't posted online). There are 7 HWs that are usually challenging (3rd and 4th are the hardest). The semester project is open ended which is nice. Know Matlab, otherwise it will be very difficult",
